{"id": "unknown-2026-09-19-003", "date": "2026-09-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Trump signs law as India risks 100% tariffs over Russian oil", "content": "US President Donald Trump has signed H.R. 5334, expanding sanctions, tariffs and prohibitions on Russia and extending existing sanctions on Iran. \nThe law can expose goods from top Russian oil and gas buyers, including India and China, to duties of up to 100 per cent. \nImporters and sourcing teams face possible tariff changes within 30 days of signing. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/trump-signs-law-as-india-risks-100-tariffs-over-russian-oil-313618-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
