{"id": "unknown-2026-09-19-005", "date": "2026-09-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": ["improve", "uncertainty"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s trade gains face new tariff uncertainty", "content": "New Zealand’s Parliament has passed legislation to implement the India FTA, with all Indian goods to receive duty-free access after ratification.\nFor Indian textiles, apparel and made-ups, removing 5-10 per cent duties could improve price competitiveness in New Zealand.\nA US sanctions bill could allow tariffs of up to 100 per cent on Russian energy buyers, adding risk to India-US trade talks.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-trade-gains-face-new-tariff-uncertainty-313593-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-19-006", "date": "2026-09-19", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price", "supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.62, "keywords": ["decline", "slow", "weak", "delay"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Weak demand drags cotton yarn prices lower in South India", "content": "Cotton yarn prices declined in Tiruppur and Mumbai as weak downstream demand, payment constraints and falling cotton prices kept buyers cautious.\nTiruppur prices dipped ₹4-5 per kg, while Mumbai eased ₹3-5 per kg amid slow local demand and reduced fabric production.\nGujarat cotton prices fell with ICE futures; mills avoided stocks ahead of new-crop arrivals, which scanty rains may delay.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/weak-demand-drags-cotton-yarn-prices-lower-in-south-india-313610-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
